Request for Feedback on Our New Fact-Checking Feature 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌

Hi there, 

Maddie here from Originality.AI. Today, we're covering two things! 

**1-**We are excited to announce the winner of our recent contest, where
we asked you to help us share our new Fact-Checking Feature.

**2- **Request for Feedback on the Originality.AI Fact-Checking
Feature .

**Apple AirPod Winner:**

We are pleased to announce that the winner of our contest is

**Jason F from Texas!**Congratulations, Jason! You will be receiving a
brand-new pair of Apple AirPods. We will be reaching out to you shortly
to coordinate the delivery of your prize. Thank you for your
contribution!

We wanted to extend our thanks to all the participants who took the time
to engage with our contest which helped us share our new Fact-Checking
Feature  with the world!

We will be adding 500 credits to your account if you had 20 or more
entries. We look forward to many more engaging and fun activities in the
future. 

https://jonhaver.acemlnb.com/lt.php?s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=2054A2201A61A31198 

**Request for Feedback:**

At Originality.AI we are committed to our
continuous improvement in providing you with the best and most accurate
tools to assist you with your content creation. 

Our Fact-Checking Feature was created in response to your repeated
requests! We really appreciate and value your feedback- and will work
hard to make them happen. 

If you have had a chance to explore the new Fact-Checking Feature, we
would really appreciate your insights. Please share your thoughts,
suggestions, and any issues you might have encountered. Your feedback
will help us fine-tune this tool and ensure it meets your expectations.

We appreciate your input and look forward to working together to make
Originality.AI even better.

To provide your feedback, simply fill out the quick form below. 

Fact-Checking Feedback Form 

Once again, congratulations to Jason F from Texas, and thank you all
for your contributions, feedback and your continued support.

Have a great day!

Sent to: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com

Unsubscribe

Jon Gillham, 1 First Street Suite #220, Collingwood, Ontario L9Y 1A1, Canada
